{"type":"text","timestamp":1794544676855,"sessionID":"ses_e2cd19d92ffeD6u5HsfuPaRRpf","part":{"id":"prt_1d3329832001vYwye3YtU8AFB5","sessionID":"ses_e2cd19d92ffeD6u5HsfuPaRRpf","messageID":"msg_1d33288ca0013Of9jLu2HW3KaA","type":"text","text":"Task complete. T022 is done and verified.\n\n## Files written\n\n1. `.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/hub-router.json` — appended one alias to each of three `vocabularyClasses.keywords` arrays, keeping every array on its existing single line:\n   - `research-aliases` += `\"find out everything\"` (11 → 12 keywords)\n   - `review-aliases` += `\"findings stop changing\"` (16 → 17)\n   - `ai-council-aliases` += `\"several models\"` (9 → 10)\n   - `hub-identity` untouched.\n2. `.skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/013-live-activation/activation/system-deep-loop/manifest.json` — rewritten by `REFRESH system-deep-loop` (policy hash `e6eb63…` → `07ae60…`).\n3. `specs/sk-doc/z_archive/019-skill-routing-refactor/015-router-unification-program/013-live-activation/activation/system-deep-loop/manifest.json` — authored twin copied from the served manifest.\n4. `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/012-plain-offer-reach/scratch/routes-deep-loop-after.tsv` — new 139-line route table.\n\nNo other file was modified. `tasks.md` was not touched, so T022 stays unticked as instructed.\n\n## Verify output\n\n`REFRESH system-deep-loop` — refresh reported `\"fresh\":true,\"refreshed\":true`; guard step:\n```\n0\n```\n\n`HUBOK system-deep-loop` — four checks:\n```\nfresh\ncmp exit: 0\nall 55 served copies match their authored files\nOK: parent-skill-check — all hard invariants passed, 0 warnings\n```\n\n`RT system-deep-loop $CF_LOOP > $SP/routes-deep-loop-after.tsv` then `diff … | rg '^>'`:\n```\n> cmd-deep-ai-council-plain-tune-01\t{\"action\":\"route\",\"t\":[\"ai-council\"]}\n> cmd-deep-research-plain-tune-01\t{\"action\":\"route\",\"t\":[\"research\"]}\n> cmd-deep-review-plain-tune-01\t{\"action\":\"route\",\"t\":[\"review\"]}\n```\nExactly the three expected lines. The matching `<` side shows those same three ids moved from `{\"action\":\"defer\",\"t\":[]}` to their mode, so no other id changed route. `wc -l` is 139.\n\n`rg -n '^nm-system-deep-loop-01'` on both files:\n```\n117:nm-system-deep-loop-01\t{\"action\":\"route\",\"t\":[\"research\"]}\n117:nm-system-deep-loop-01\t{\"action\":\"route\",\"t\":[\"research\"]}\n```\nIdentical.\n\n`BINT` (`node --test .skilled/bin/tests/compiled-route-*.test.cjs`):\n```\nℹ tests 104\nℹ suites 6\nℹ pass 104\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Repo rule `skill-hub-routing.md` was loaded for the hub-router edit; its per-hub gate was run with the explicit hub path, and both routing stages were replayed through `RT`, not inferred from a registry entry alone.\n- `git status` inside the compiled-routing tree also shows `.../sk-doc/manifest.json` modified. That is another worker's T010 change, not mine.\n- Nothing could not be done. The task's Verify list does not include `TC`, so I did not run it.","time":{"start":1794544670770,"end":1794544676855}}}
